 Sorimachi","role":"'Yun' Yuta Yoshii","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xBA2SFFNRGgWI4YH1uWkXzHdf1q.jpg"},{"id":58604,"name":"Nao Omori","role":"'Chen' Hajime Fujimaki","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vksNisBd3SG6WNtBuIJzVXWRjhO.jpg"},{"id":135524,"name":"Kenjiro Tsuda","role":"'Kinpo' Kisuke Kikuhara","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yFpSPNHqYN4rdRiVpVaYmqXMkmi.jpg"},{"id":2092978,"name":"Mai Kiryu","role":"'Matilda' Michiru Miyashita","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2NsaouRvBljwKh0XWhbhfJ5T41V.jpg"},{"id":2053795,"name":"Riko Fukumoto","role":"Hakuba Nishino","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kn57QYPmigWihRaSOtsRmjglbN4.jpg"},{"id":2636358,"name":"Noritaka Hamao","role":"Tsurumi","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qkWQn0zyeg967iWzPXEDo8BvK7P.jpg"},{"id":1733634,"name":"Yuki Matsumura","role":"Kento Yoshii","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oMckcRhXAFoq1sVEm1doXbXzaDS.jpg"},{"id":145929,"name":"Noriko Nakagoshi","role":"Satsuki Onodera","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5WityXdqwxB1xteFzsJj5bCaEfj.jpg"},{"id":46623,"name":"Keiko Takahashi","role":"Shoko Kikuhara","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ksiS9bcT5gHrT3DN8VSsMnDMqfF.jpg"},{"id":5488314,"name":"Hideo Osumi","role":"Young 'Yun' Yuta Yoshii Yuta"},{"id":5043467,"name":"Kirato Uchida","role":"Young 'Kinpo' Kisuke Kikuhara"},{"id":6357021,"name":"Maika Miura","role":"Aya Yoshii","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6FEA6sOzV3zKqF45amYaOqoYb45.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"en-US","title":"Soda Master","overview":"Three former middle school friends who reunited after 37 years to pursue the mystery behind their former club advisor's disappearance."},{"language":"ja-JP","overview":"主人公は、吉井雄太＜よしい・ゆうた／通称ユン＞、藤巻肇＜ふじまき・はじめ／通称チェン＞、菊原紀介＜きくはら・きすけ／通称キンポー＞という見た目も性格もバラバラな凸凹３人組。\n\n1988年、中学時代は映画研究部でカンフー映画制作に夢中だった彼らも、今や51歳。「こんなはずじゃなかった」と三者三様に人生に行き詰まりを感じていた…。そんなある日、「丹辺市の建設現場から人骨発見」のニュースが！\n\n少年時代を過ごした町の名前に心がザワついた紀介。２人に連絡し、37年ぶりに３人が再会する！昔話に花が咲く中、中学時代憧れだった顧問の女性教師の記憶が曖昧になっていることに気づき－!？映画研究部の集合写真と共に掘り出された紙には“行方不明”の文字も。\n\n「俺たち、なんか大事なことを忘れてない…!？」\n\n顧問教師の謎の失踪事件を追いながら、３人は再び走り出す！人生の迷子たちが、もう一度“青春の輝き”を取り戻す、笑って泣けるヒューマンコメディ！あの頃の自分に、もう一度会いに行く！"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6P4mbhpsmHQdDcngIv8N7rw1r0n.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ite3lj4atrXI9d3ZvF39hnbBNrd.jpg","seasons":[{"seasonNumber":1,"name":{"value":"Stagione 1","language":"it-IT"},"year":2026,"episodeCount":11,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ld7CgESRMjltlUbuJga6AUVltd9.jpg","posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/306129/season/1"}],"schema":{}}},"enrichment":{"status":"ready","hasMissingEpisodeMetadata":true}}
